1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,870
The Control Centre shows your PC's health at a glance.

2
00:00:04,570 --> 00:00:08,298
Here you'll see CPU, graphics, and memory usage,

3
00:00:08,298 --> 00:00:11,870
with temperatures where Windows provides them.

4
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:17,854
The YouTube Music card shows the current song, artwork, and progress.

5
00:00:17,854 --> 00:00:21,760
You can play, pause, skip, or drag the bar to seek.

6
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:28,149
You'll also see mouse and keyboard battery for Bluetooth devices, plus storage,

7
00:00:28,149 --> 00:00:30,021
network speed, and uptime.

8
00:00:30,021 --> 00:00:35,350
If a value isn't available, PadDeck says Unavailable, instead of guessing.

9
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:40,413
The Audio section switches speakers and microphones with one tap,

10
00:00:40,413 --> 00:00:43,300
and sets the volume of each app separately.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,541
On the PC, the same information is on the Dashboard.

12
00:00:47,541 --> 00:00:51,900
Press Customize to choose which cards appear, and in what order.

